comments.body:
Blocked on v1: the release needs cutting first, and #3147 defers the agent runtime past v1 as well, so I would rather not land a second path to reading outside the diff in between.

@misery one thing is usable now. #3105 made `[artifacts]` readable from the CLI, so a CI job can write a summary of its failed jobs to a file and pr-agent will pick it up as review context. It does none of the relatedness judgement or cross-job dedup you asked for, but it puts the failure in front of the reviewer today.

@naorpeled unassigning rather than leaving this parked on you. Happy to pick it up together after v1.
